e=3D"font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;disp=
lay:inline;">Our business planning process is rigorous, sets ambitious goal=
s and considers factors such as the prevailing economic environment, our ri=
sk appetite, customers=E2=80=99 evolving needs and opportunities available =
across our operating groups. It includes clear and direct accountability fo=
r annual performance that is measured against both internal and external be=
nchmarks and progress toward our strategic priorities. We seek a balance be=
tween current profitability and investing to create sustainable growth. Our=
 ability to achieve these objectives may be affected by changes in the econ=
omic, business or regulatory environment or extraordinary developments. </d=
iv></div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt;=
