nt-size:8pt; font-family:arial">The reported provision for income taxes was=
 $703&nbsp;million, an increase of $219&nbsp;million from the fourth quarte=
r of&nbsp;fiscal 2023, and the adjusted provision for income taxes was&nbsp=
;$427&nbsp;million, a decrease of $241&nbsp;million. The reported effective=
 tax rate was&nbsp;23.4%, compared with&nbsp;22.1% in the fourth quarter of=
&nbsp;fiscal 2023, and the adjusted effective tax rate was 21.7%, compared =
with&nbsp;22.9%. The change in the reported effective tax rate relative to =
the fourth quarter of&nbsp;2023 was primarily due to the impact of higher i=
ncome in the current year, and the change in the adjusted effective tax rat=
e was primarily due to earnings mix, including the impact of lower income i=
n the current quarter. </div><div style=3D"margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0p=
