ng: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Our customer securitization vehicles pro=
vide customers with access to financing either from us or from the asset-ba=
cked commercial paper (ABCP) markets. Customers sell either their assets or=
 an interest in their assets into these vehicles, which then issue ABCP eit=
her to investors or to us, in order to fund the purchases. The sellers rema=
in responsible for servicing the transferred assets and are first to absorb=
 any losses realized on those assets. We are not responsible for servicing =
or absorbing the first loss and none of the sellers are affiliated with BMO=
. </div></div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; font-family: arial; font-size:=
