g as at October&nbsp;31,&nbsp;2024 ($12.2&nbsp;billion as at October 31, 20=
23). The ABCP issued by the Canadian market-funded vehicles is rated <div s=
tyle=3D"white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"=
