t; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Fiscal and monetary polic=
ies and other economic conditions prevailing in Canada, the United States a=
nd other jurisdictions in which we do business may impact profitability and=
 heighten economic uncertainty in specific businesses and markets, which ma=
y in turn affect our customers and counterparties, reduce profitability and=
 contribute to a greater risk of credit losses. Levels of business debt rem=
ain elevated due to the residual effects of the pandemic and the loss of go=
vernmental supports, which could impact our markets and our operating resul=
ts. Interest rate fluctuations could have an impact on our earnings, the va=
lue of our investments, the credit quality of our loans to customers and co=
unterparty exposure, as well as the capital markets that we access. </div><=
/div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; mar=
