rial; font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Credit=
 and counterparty risk underlies every lending activity that we enter into,=
 and also arises in the holding of investment securities, transactions rela=
ted to trading and other capital markets products, and activities related t=
o securitization. Credit and counterparty risk represents the most signific=
ant measurable risk we face. Effective management of credit and counterpart=
y risk is integral to our success, since failure to do so could have an imm=
ediate and significant impact on our earnings, financial condition and repu=
tation. </div></div> <ix:continuation id=3D"TextSelectionAppend_127466747_1=
