: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">The credit ratings as=
signed to BMO=E2=80=99s short-term and senior long-term debt securities by =
external rating agencies are important in raising both capital and funding =
to support the bank=E2=80=99s business operations. Maintaining strong credi=
t ratings allows us to access the wholesale markets at competitive pricing =
levels. Should BMO=E2=80=99s credit ratings experience a downgrade, our cos=
t of funding may increase and our access to funding and capital through the=
 wholesale markets could be constrained. A material downgrade of BMO=E2=80=
=99s ratings could also have other consequences, including those set out in=
 Note&nbsp;8 of the audited annual consolidated financial statements. </div=
