is a financial statement-based proxy representing activity within the bank =
and ILM is a proxy representing the control environment relative to activit=
y. ILM is a mathematical calculation based on <div style=3D"white-space:now=
rap;display:inline;">10-year</div> average historical losses (net of recove=
ries) and the three-year average BIC. </div></td></tr></tbody></table>
