 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Risk is inherent in mo=
dels because model results are estimates that rely on statistical, mathemat=
ical or other quantitative techniques to approximate reality and transform =
data into estimates or forecasts of future outcomes. Model risk also arises=
 from the potential misuse of models or model results. Model risk is govern=
ed at BMO by a risk-based enterprise-wide Model Risk Management Framework. =
</div></div><div style=3D"font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: =
