spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Our pension and other employee futu=
re benefits expense is calculated by independent actuaries using assumption=
s determined by management. Differences between actual experience and the a=
ssumptions used are recognized in other comprehensive income. </div></div><=
div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; margin-to=
p: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">Pension and other employee future benefits exp=
ense, plan assets and defined benefit obligations are sensitive to changes =
in discount rates. We determine discount rates at each <div style=3D"white-=
space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">year-end</div=
> for all plans, using high-quality corporate bonds with terms matching the=
 plans=E2=80=99 specific cash flows. </div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; f=
ont-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><d=
