t; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">As at October&nbsp;31,&nb=
sp;2024 and&nbsp;October&nbsp;31,&nbsp;2023, no goodwill impairment was rec=
orded, as the estimated fair value of the CGUs was greater than their carry=
ing value. </div></div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4%; font-family: arial; f=
ont-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><div style=3D"font-fam=
ily: arial; font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">=
