ars, depending on the nature of the asset. We test intangible assets with d=
efinite lives for impairment when circumstances indicate that the&nbsp;carr=
ying value may not be recoverable. </div></div><div style=3D"text-indent: 4=
%; font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;=
"><div style=3D"font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 0px; to=
p: 0px;display:inline;">Intangible assets with indefinite lives are tested =
