op: 0px;display:inline;">Pre-Tax</div> Earnings (PPPT)</div></div> is calcu=
lated as income before the provision for income taxes and provision for (re=
covery of) credit losses. We use PPPT on both a reported and an adjusted ba=
sis to assess our ability to generate sustained earnings growth excluding c=
redit losses, which are impacted by the cyclical nature of a credit cycle. =
</div><div style=3D"font-family: arial; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 6pt; ma=
